start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {7dc}@ring ss@top
R2: 3ch=dc 5dc@st [dc 5dc@st]x3 ss@top
R3: 3ch=dc dc@same ch 2sk 5dc@st ch 2sk [3dc@st ch 2sk 5dc@st ch 2sk]x3 dc@st ss@top # last dc goes into the first st
R4: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {2dc}@same ch 2sk 5dc@st [ch 2sk 3dc@sp ch 3dc@sp ch 2sk 5dc@st]x3 ch 2sk 3dc@sp ch ss@top
R5: 3ch=dc 2dc dc@sp 2dc 5dc@st 2dc dc@sp [3dc dc@sp 3dc dc@sp 2dc 5dc@st 2dc dc@sp]x3 3dc dc@sp ss@top
R6-8: 3ch=dc [dc]>corner [5dc@st [dc]>corner]x3 5dc@st [dc]>end ss@top
R9: 4ch=tr ch {3dc}@same [ch 2sk [3dc@st ch 3sk]x6 3dc@st ch 2sk {3dc ch tr ch 3dc}@st]x3 ch 2sk [3dc@st ch 3sk]x6 3dc@st ch 2sk {3dc ch}@st ss@top # last group goes into the starting corner st
R10: 4ch=tr ch [3dc@sp ch]x10 [tr ch [3dc@sp ch]x10]x3 ss@top
R11: 3ch=dc {2dc}@same [dc@sp [3dc dc@sp]x10 5dc@st]x3 dc@sp [3dc dc@sp]x10 {2dc}@st ss@top # last 2 dc into the starting corner st
R12-16: 3ch=dc {2dc}@same [[dc]>corner 5dc@st]x3 [dc]>end {2dc}@st ss@top
